<BaseLayout title="About RoamDawn | Travel Guides & Destination Research" description="Learn what RoamDawn covers, how the editorial team approaches travel research and how readers can contact us."><section class="container max-w-4xl py-14"><p class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#168ac0]">About RoamDawn</p><h1 class="mt-2 text-5xl font-black">Travel information made clearer.</h1><div class="prose mt-8"><p>RoamDawn is a travel publication focused on destination guides, city planning, itineraries and practical trip research.</p><h2>What we publish</h2><p>Our structure starts with destination hubs, then moves into pillar guides and supporting city or itinerary articles. This gives readers a clear path from “Where should I go?” to “How should I plan it?”</p><h2>Editorial standards</h2><p>We do not invent first-hand travel experiences, fake awards, fake reviews or credentials. Where information can change, we encourage readers to check official sources before travel.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>Travel information evolves. Readers can contact the team with corrections or questions, and important updates can be reflected in future revisions.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> for editorial feedback.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>